OL,3,GNEWSALondon boroughs challenge PM on
OL,4,Acouncil tax hikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Conservative council leaders in
OL,7,FLondon have written to Andy Burnham,
OL,8,Faccusing the government of "devolving
OL,9,Fblame" for council tax hikes.
OL,11,FThe leaders of Westminster, Wandsworth
OL,12,Fand Kensington and Chelsea councils
OL,13,Fsaid they were being forced to
OL,14,Fsignificantly raise council tax or cut
OL,15,Fservices to plug a hole left by cuts to
OL,16,Fcentral government funding.
OL,18,FIt follows a reform of council funding,
OL,19,Fwhich means more cash is directed to
OL,20,Fdeprived areas.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
