OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon boroughs challenge PM on
OL,4,Acouncil tax hikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tories want the change reviewed,
OL,7,Fclaiming it will "worsen the lives of
OL,8,Flocal residents across London and the
OL,9,FSouth East". But the government said it
OL,10,Fwas "fixing an outdated system" that
OL,11,Fbenefited wealthy areas while poorer
OL,12,Fcommunities lost out.
